# ============================================================
# Build OUTPUT
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT: the compiled dedicated/headless server is built into
#   Interflow/Server/   and is INTENTIONALLY committed to git
#   (by project decision). Do NOT add "Server/" to this ignore list.
#
# Client builds and generic build folders are ignored below.
# ============================================================
/[Cc]lient[Bb]uild*/
/[Bb]uild[Oo]utput*/
/ExportedObj/
# Optional: Burst debug symbols are NOT needed to run the server.
# Uncomment to keep the committed server build smaller:
# **/*_BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip/

# ============================================================
# Recordings / crash reports / package exports
# ============================================================
/[Rr]ecordings/
crashlytics-build.properties
sysinfo.txt
*.unitypackage
*.app
*.apk
*.aab

